        <p>🧗 Safety Gear – Technical equipment like ropes, ice axe, microspikes, etc., wherever needed</p>
        <p>🩺 Basic Medical Support – On-trek first aid and support for minor medical issues</p>
        <p>👥 Support Staff – Team includes experienced trek leaders, local guides, cooks, and helpers</p>
        <p>🎯 Qualified Leadership – Professional trek leader overseeing safety and coordination</p>
      </div>
      <div class="exclusions">
